# Azure Deployment Plan for spring-petclinic

## Project Information
- **Stack**: Spring Boot 4.0.1, Java 17
- **Type**: Web application (Spring MVC + Thymeleaf)
- **Build Tool**: Maven (with wrapper)
- **Containerization**: Dockerfile created (multi-stage build)
- **Hosting**: Azure Container Apps

## Azure Resources Architecture
```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Compute Resources"
        subgraph containerappenv["Container Apps Environment"]
            containerApp["spring-petclinic (Container App)"]
        end
    end
    subgraph "Supporting Services"
        acr["Azure Container Registry"]
        logAnalytics["Log Analytics Workspace"]
        appInsights["Application Insights"]
        managedIdentity["User-Assigned Managed Identity"]
    end
    containerApp --> |"image pull (system-identity)"| acr
    containerApp --> |"logs"| logAnalytics
    containerApp --> |"telemetry"| appInsights
    containerApp --> |"identity"| managedIdentity
    managedIdentity --> |"AcrPull role"| acr
```

## Generated Files
- `Dockerfile` - Multi-stage Docker build (Azure Linux + JDK 17)
- `.dockerignore` - Docker build context exclusions
- `infra/main.bicep` - Main Bicep template (subscription scope)
- `infra/resources.bicep` - Azure resource definitions
- `infra/main.parameters.json` - Deployment parameters
- `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` - CI/CD pipeline (build, test, deploy to dev/staging/production)
- `.github/workflows/infra-deploy.yml` - Infrastructure provisioning workflow
- `.azure/pipeline-setup.md` - Setup guide for Azure auth and GitHub environments

## Execution Steps
- [x] Repository analyzed
- [x] Deployment plan generated
- [x] Dockerfile created (multi-stage: build with Maven, runtime with JDK 17 distroless)
- [x] Bicep IaC files generated (Container App, ACR, Log Analytics, App Insights, Managed Identity)
- [x] GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline created (3 environments: dev, staging, production)
- [x] Infrastructure provisioning workflow created
- [x] Pipeline setup documentation generated
